{"id":"6afd7491-5308-83e8-bdf3-4619eb561c21","sections":[{"bodySize":601,"controls":{"checkbox":20,"fields":0,"radio":0,"reveal":1,"submit":5,"textarea":0},"count":5,"heading":"九、本章綜合習題","html":"<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下題目比前面的理解檢查稍難，著重跨概念判斷與推理。先自行作答，再展開解析。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 4);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: 2px;\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">綜合練習</p><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Caption-s5Z8Hg\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"caption\" data-d-size=\"lg\" data-d-weight=\"normal\">共 5 題，含單選與多選</span></div><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Badge-v4RzAb\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">0/5 已作答</div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">1. 某高分子材料具有良好的彈性，但經過大量交聯處理後，材料變硬且較不容易伸長。最合理的原因為何？</p><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_g4_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_g4_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>A. 高分子鏈中的所有共價鍵都消失</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_g5_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_g5_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>B. 交聯限制分子鏈的構形變化與相對移動</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_g6_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_g6_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>C. 材料中的原子數必然減少</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_g7_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_g7_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>D. 交聯必然使材料變成金屬</span></label></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">2. 關於 n 型與 p 型矽半導體，下列哪些敘述正確？（多選）</p><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_ga_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_ga_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>A. n 型半導體通常以電子為多數載子</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_gb_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_gb_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>B. p 型半導體通常以電洞為多數載子</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_gc_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_gc_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>C. n 型矽整體一定帶負電</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_gd_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_gd_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>D. 摻雜能改變半導體的導電能力</span></label></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-si