Apa\"><span>D. 液晶分子不受電場影響</span></label></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">4. 將一個邊長為 12 nm 的立方體切割成 8 個相同的小立方體，假設切割不損失材料，總表面積變成原來的幾倍？</p><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_gm_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_gm_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>A. 1 倍</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_gn_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_gn_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>B. 2 倍</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_go_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_go_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>C. 4 倍</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_gp_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_gp_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>D. 8 倍</span></label></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">5. 關於導電聚乙炔與奈米材料，下列哪些敘述合理？（多選）</p><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_gs_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_gs_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>A. 聚乙炔的共軛結構有利於電子離域</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_gt_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_gt_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>B. 純聚乙炔必定與銅具有相同導電率</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_gu_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_gu_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>C. 奈米材料可能因尺寸效應而改變光學性質</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_gv_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_gv_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>D. 奈米材料的所有特殊性質都能由表面積公式完全解釋</span></label></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案</span></button></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"solid\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">顯示全部答案與解析</span></button></div>","messageId":"794e2c4a-5af9-49e1-84ed-785a9ce36a19","numbered":["1","2","3","4","5"],"progress":[]}]}